{"version":1,"content":"<p>導演何爵天昨晚（27日）出席電影《善男信女》慈善首映禮，談及其執導的HOY首部處境劇《你的保安李寶安》首集錄得最高收視9.4點，他坦言不敢自滿，期望繼續爭取更佳成績。</p><p>他說︰「只有首播錄得9.4點沒有用，最重要是繼續做好，期望收視能夠保持，並進一步攀升。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.449206+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:58:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:09.983549+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.449206+00:00","content_hash":"167d08689b7f70e66df73dacf2230bd34bc1a3dbca1f51e8a473fb96ac8e9277","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}